## 五、PC 端联调

```bash
# 建立反向隧道（PC 的 8765 → 手机的 8765）
adb reverse tcp:8765 tcp:8765

# 启动消费端
python pc/sentinel_receiver.py --adb --action notify --action lock --absent-seconds 8
```

手机端 App 里点「开始检测」。

### 事件格式

```json
{"event":"hello","app":"sentinel","backend":"ncnn-int8-cpu","model":"ssd_mobilenetv2","ts":1730000000000}
{"event":"presence","present":false,"confidence":0.0,"ts":1730000000123}
{"event":"stats","fps":14.8,"infer_ms":12,"device":"cpu(NEON)","ts":1730000001000}
```

